{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 500,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every decade has its dessert trends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2419,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the 2000s, it was cupcakes and frozen yogurt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5213,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then in the 2010s, it was unicorn drinks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7549,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "monster milkshakes, edible\ndough, and donuts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10343,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now in the 2020s, it's massive, thick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12554,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "topped 800-calorie cookies\nthat come in extravagant flavors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15932,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and have twice as much sugar\nas a can of Coke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18476,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's impossible to not see the thousands\ngorging themselves on these cookies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21896,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in their car every week for millions\nacross social media."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25191,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cookies are the latest consumer obsession"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27152,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet the trendsetters\nare never the first movers. For cupcakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30655,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was Sprinkles, for frozen yogurt,\nit was Pinkberry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33491,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now for cookies, it's Crumbl."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35201,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the trend is said,\nall you need to do is follow it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37537,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't need to be the trendsetter\nto make money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39581,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if it only lasts for a few years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41958,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why when frozen yogurt and cupcakes took off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44085,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the 2000s, opportunists quickly\nflooded the market, selling virtually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47672,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same product to capture whatever\nPinkberry and Sprinkles couldn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51718,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Supply rushed in to fill demand, and \nsellers exceeded buyers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54387,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the point of market saturation\nand consumer fatigue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57390,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every dessert fad is a volatile, short-lived market \nwith its own business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60977,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cycle that seemed unstoppable at its peak\nand then crashes over time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64981,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This boom-and-bust cycle\nis the norm, and it's happening right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67901,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with cookies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68860,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbl is the market maker\nwho has somehow maintained novelty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71780,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and virality all while\npushing price, product, and scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75283,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their growth is unprecedented\nin the history of food and beverage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78036,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going from a single store\nto an empire of over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80413,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1000 locations in four years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82749,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And unsurprisingly, a whole landscape\nof copycat chains and independents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86503,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have suddenly emerged, each hoping to cash\nin while the trend lasts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90340,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But cookies have been around\nfor centuries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92383,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before Crumbl, there were old-school giants like Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94719,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields and new-school entrants\nlike Insomnia and Levain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97806,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet none of them ever came\nclose to the success of Crumbl."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100683,
    "dDurationMs": 1669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this Modern MBA Original,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102352,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're diving into the business of cookies\nfrom the macro-to-micro,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105438,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting with these legacy brands\nand moving to Crumbl "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108108,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where we'll break down their never-before-seen \nfinancials to understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111111,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how they succeeded where others failed\nand what their end game really is and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114823,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then experience what life is like\nunder Crumbl as a small independent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118326,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the standpoint of two beloved\nneighborhood mom-and-pops in LA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127068,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mrs. Fields in the 1970s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128861,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "paved the way forward for modern cookie\nshops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131280,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was an era where Americans\nbake their own cookies at home,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134450,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pick them up from fast food chains\nlike McDonald's or prepackaged"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137537,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off grocery shelves like Chips Ahoy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139497,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mrs. Fields upset the status\nquo by elevating the lowly cookie"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142917,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from a generic mass-produced cross-sell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145086,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a premium flagship branded product\nthat was as good as homemade"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148631,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where every cookie was baked on-site\nand served warm to customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152385,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cookies are made from everyday low\ncost ingredients of flour, sugar, butter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155972,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and eggs, and in comparison\nto cakes and pastries, which are also made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159267,
    "dDurationMs": 1042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the same ingredients,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160309,
    "dDurationMs": 1127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cookies are much easier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161436,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to produce with little technique,\nlabor, and precision required."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165064,
    "dDurationMs": 1502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dough could be produced in bulk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166566,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and shipped to each location\nfor consistency and simplicity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169819,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a cookie shop at scale\nonly really needs an oven, cash"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173030,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "register, and display case\nand can be manned by a single person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176409,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With such low real-estate\nand operational requirements,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179120,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mrs. Fields grew without franchising from a single shop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181956,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 780 stores nationwide in six years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185209,
    "dDurationMs": 1043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the eighties, Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186252,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields had become an institution\nat shopping malls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188588,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and food courts around the country\nwith strong margins,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191174,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "given that cookies only cost cents to make\nbut sold for a dollar each."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194886,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet while the margins were high,\nthe downside was low earnings,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198139,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so Mrs. Fields continually added candy\nice cream, brownies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201225,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and muffins over the decades\nin order to drive up sales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204312,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when the 1990s recession hit, Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206481,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields found itself in a cash crunch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208399,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She had borrowed money to scale,\nand the absence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210526,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of franchising meant maximum\nrisk exposure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213154,
    "dDurationMs": 792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sales dropped,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213946,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "real estate value fell,\nand hundreds of stores shuttered overnight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216991,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as they could no longer afford rent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219035,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mrs. Field's initial prosperity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220703,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had attracted rivals like Famous Amos\nand David's Cookies and yet their own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224832,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brick-and-mortar ambitions were crushed\nunder the same recession."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228211,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Famous Amos pivoted to CPG while David's Cookies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231088,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shifted to wholesale, business models\nthat both companies have kept"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234091,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to this day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235009,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Saddled with debt, Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236302,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields gave up control of her company\nand its new private"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238971,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equity owners demanded lower costs and greater profits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242308,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They envisioned a broader, multi-category franchise empire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245186,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and by 2001 bought Pretzel Time, Hot Sam's, and TCBY"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249023,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under the belief that pretzels and frozen yogurt\ncould hedge against cookies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252401,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet all of these brands\nhad the same problem as Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254779,
    "dDurationMs": 542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255321,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were all walk-in businesses\nwith no standalone appeal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258032,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and could only survive in high traffic\nareas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260701,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Under franchising, earnings\nshrank, but profits quadrupled as Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264288,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields moved away from serving the public and more towards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266874,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "selling dough and collecting royalties\nfrom franchisees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270002,
    "dDurationMs": 751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as the shopping"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270753,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mall went belly up in the Great Recession,\nthe business tanked once again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274048,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 2010, the company had sold off its pretzel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276259,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chains to refocus on cookies,\nbut the damage was done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278970,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The average Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279804,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Field's grosses less today than it did 20 years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282640,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why, if you come across a Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284308,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Field's store today, you'll usually find it\nmanned by a single person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287395,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who in most cases is the franchisee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289480,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While an annual gross revenue of $360,000 per store"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292900,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sounds respectable, the reality is different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295111,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After deducting royalties and dough costs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297238,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the owner is grossing roughly\n$200,000 before labor and rent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301117,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after paying rent,\nthere's nothing left for payroll."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303870,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This means that the only way for the \nowner to take home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306122,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a worthwhile salary is to work\nall the hours themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309250,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mrs. Field stores have been dropping like\nflies and extinction seems inevitable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313379,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The company today is a zombie, milking\nits remaining"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315798,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "franchisees and its online gift business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318134,
    "dDurationMs": 792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite declining"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318926,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sales, the cash flow from the gift\nbusiness is too sacred to give away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322513,
    "dDurationMs": 459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322972,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields maintains a 12% profit margin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325141,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "selling cookies in metal tins and gift\nbaskets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327852,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the same margins\nthat the company enjoyed decades ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330563,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "selling the same cookies one\nat a time at retail, which is a testament"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333941,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to how profitable\nselling cookies can be at their core."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337028,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With such low barriers to entry,\ncompetition can come from anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340531,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insomnia was born out of a college dorm\nroom in the 2000s. While Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344327,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields made its name through product,\nInsomnia made its name through location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348080,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They've built their empire over the past\nfew decades"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350583,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "following the same fundamental \nplaybook of serving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352960,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "opportunistic walk-ins in high traffic areas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355755,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But instead of serving shoppers at malls,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357840,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they target students with the late-night\nmunchies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360009,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no family\nrecipes, special ingredients,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362511,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even proprietary dough\nas Insomnia cookies are indistinguishable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366015,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from those sold\nat any run-of-the-mill supermarket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368768,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their bet has been that\nconvenience is a greatest premium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371520,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and quality is lost in the typical\n20 year old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374148,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The average store\ngrosses about $700,000-$800,000 a year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377902,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this feels more like a ceiling\nrather than a floor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380613,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Expansion has been slow\nas Insomnia is more of a real estate play."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384408,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are only so many colleges\nin the country and they've been careful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387328,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not to open in places where they would be\nforced to compete on product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390665,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In response to Crumbl, Insomnia\nhas broadened with limited-time drops,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394418,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brownies, ice cream, and now filled cookies\nto fortify its position"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398130,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the fastest late night option\nfor desserts on-campus or in-transit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402301,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The challenge that Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403177,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields and Insomnia both ran into is the fact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405429,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that gross earnings in this business\nare just not that high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407932,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can only charge so much\nfor a single cookie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410434,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only way to make up for the small\norder sizes is through cross-selling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413729,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a wide product mix or by inserting yourself into high-traffic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416732,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "areas in the hopes of capturing as much volume"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419110,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as possible. Out of New York City,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421445,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was Levain in the 1990s who solved\nthis problem by transforming cookies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425157,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from a cheap, traditional, thin, flat\ntwo-ounce serving into these decadent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429120,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "premium, upscale, six-ounce \nsoftball-sized indulgences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432957,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Levain is the pioneer of the modern\noversized cookie as their product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436627,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "challenged what cookies could be\nand how much you could sell them for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439797,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fueled by critical acclaim,\nLevine has achieved lasting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442466,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pricing power as their cookies sell for nearly $6 each."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445803,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By estimates, Levine grosses on average\n$1.2 million per store."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450016,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For decades, its owners were happy\nkeeping Levain as a New York institution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453686,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as tourists and locals came to them\nrather than vice-versa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456939,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was only decades later in 2018\nwhen they sold Levain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459900,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to private equity, and its new owners\nare now pushing for stronger growth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463612,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet to maintain Levain's position\nand reputation at the tip of the market,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467241,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expansion has remained slow,\nas franchising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469660,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not an option\nand brand dilution is the top concern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472997,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbl was founded in 2017\nand their late start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475875,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gave them time to absorb the lessons\nfrom all those that had come before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479170,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They started with the intention to scale,\nknowing that the greatest profits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482173,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could only come through franchising.\nLike Insomnia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484467,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they opened their first store\non a college campus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486552,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using the low-stakes and foot traffic\nto iterate on product and branding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490097,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But to avoid a territorial battle\nwith the more mature Insomnia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493225,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they knew they had to grow beyond\nopportunistic sales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495978,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like Levain, Crumbl cookies from\nthe start were designed as oversized,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499398,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "photogenic, six-ounce behemoths"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501484,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to drive differentiation,\nvirality, and pricing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504528,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbl isn't at the tip of the market\nlike Levain, but they're close."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507656,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While every other cookie chain sticks\nto a set menu for consistency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510993,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbl deviates from this norm\nwith weekly rotating flavors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514455,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a page out of the fashion industry\nwhere the prevailing belief"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517374,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is that scarcity, not consistency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519710,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a strongest driver of retention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521796,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Limited-time flavors create urgency,\nincentivize engagement, and encourage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525966,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "repeat visits, all of which outweigh\nthe cost of rotation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529261,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But most importantly,\nall of these elements combined"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531639,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allow Crumbl to position itself\nas a destination rather than a pit-stop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535351,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like conventional cookie\nshops. With top of the market pricing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538729,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "high retention, and social media virality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541065,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the average Crumbl went from grossing\n$700,000 in 2018,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545027,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just a year after their launch\nto roughly $1.8 million in four years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549490,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The average Crumbl\nfranchise netted nearly $300,000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552618,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a year in profit\nafter rent, labor, and supplies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555704,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Store-level operating\nmargins reached as high as 30%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558707,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is more than leading\nfast food franchises"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560876,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even what Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561710,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields as a corporation was \nmaking in its heyday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564505,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The success of these franchisees\nand the continual virality"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567424,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has inspired hundreds more to take the leap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569760,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Running a Crumbl was cheaper, easier,\nand more profitable than running"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573180,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a McDonald's, Crumbl\nexploded off the supply-side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575933,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "demand to over 900 stores by 2023."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578978,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when we dig into the numbers,\nwe can see what their endgame really is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581856,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The non-refundable franchise fee\nthat every operator must pay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584984,
    "dDurationMs": 4588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "upfront was raised from $25,000 to $50,000\nin just two years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589572,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is a fee on par with the world's\nbiggest fast food chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593033,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Royalties were also increased\nfrom 10% to 12%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595911,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in two years from 2019 to 2022."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598998,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Beyond royalties, Crumbl corporate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600791,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "makes money from kickbacks\nfrom its vendors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603210,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The cost savings\nfrom operating with economies of scale"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605754,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are not actually being passed\nonto the operators,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608007,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but instead being pocketed as company\nprofits. Crumble corporate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611510,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gets a 2% administrative\nfee, 10% on chocolate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614513,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chips, $4 off\nevery ingredient packet, and $0.50 off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618142,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every case of cereal purchased\nby franchisees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620603,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The company grosses $32 million a year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623063,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off all these rebates, kickbacks,\nand ingredient sales combined,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626066,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which it pockets under an affiliate LLC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628402,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Franchisees must also pay 3% on every transaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631488,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though the credit card processor only charges"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633699,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbl 2.36%, meaning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635701,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Crumbl corporate is once again\npocketing the difference for itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639121,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of this is uncharted territory\nin the world of franchising."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642208,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But to take such ruthless fees in\nthree years suggests that even Crumbl"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645920,
    "dDurationMs": 2168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaders don't know how long this boom will last."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648339,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're determined to milk every dollar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649882,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if that means squeezing its own\nfranchisees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652509,
    "dDurationMs": 4547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sales at the average Crumbl\nhave dropped to $1.1 million in 2023."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657056,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After paying for labor and supplies,\nthe gross margin for the average"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660267,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbl has plummeted from 60% in 2018"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663062,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 39% in 2023."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665439,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even more damning is that the store-level\noperating margins, which is the profit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669193,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after rent, has fallen from 30% to 10%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672404,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The average Crumbl franchisee is taking\nhome as much money as a present-day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676325,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mrs. Fields."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677201,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet while the franchisees are regressing,\nthe company is surging"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680162,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "having gone from $4 million to over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682206,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "$150 million in five years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684750,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The majority of revenue\ncomes from royalties and ingredient sales"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687753,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to franchisees, while store-level\noperating margins have fallen to 10%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691548,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Company-level operating margins remain\nwell over 30%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694802,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbl is currently trying to reverse\nthis slide by broadening the product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698264,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mix with cakes and pies to drive up\norder sizes and to maintain novelty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702518,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with numbers like these, it's\ndifficult to imagine how effective"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705437,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these measures will be,\nhow long this boom will last,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707982,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how many franchises will\nstill be around in the next year or two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711360,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbl's rivals like Chip City, Crave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713654,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dirty Dough, and Bang\nare all playing the same game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716657,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't just want royalties."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718033,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They want franchisees buying their marked\nup dough and ingredients week after week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721745,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're not really in the business\nof selling cookies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723831,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as all their franchise fees are priced\nin the same ballpark as crumble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727293,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But despite demanding comparable fees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729295,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they all have significantly fewer\nlocations and weaker branding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732506,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The revenue per store is all over the place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734466,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as every chain is based in a different region."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736552,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They all do weekly rotations, cross-sell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738721,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anything they can fit into their space like ice cream,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741056,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use drops to get people in the door, and push their mobile apps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744310,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's only a matter of when and not if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746270,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these same companies will start\nturning the screws on their franchisees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749648,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like what Crumbl is doing\nnow at its peak."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752318,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Out in Santa Monica is Cookie\nGood, LA's longest-surviving neighborhood"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755946,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cookie shop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756780,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Los Angeles is significant\nas the birthplace of dessert trends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760159,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pinkberry and Sprinkles\nboth started in LA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762703,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was their success here that sparked\nthe global frozen yogurt and cupcake boom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766665,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the first movers\ntypically aren't the trendsetters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769460,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Cookie Good in\nsome ways was Crumbl before Crumbl."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772796,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since 2008, they've been baking cookies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774798,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in crazy flavors and rotating their menu"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776967,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with over 300 flavors from Hot Cheetos\nto Pancakes \u0026 Bacon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780554,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are few things left that Ross\nand his wife, Melanie,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783140,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "haven't tried to turn into a cookie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845452,
    "dDurationMs": 1043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the founders of Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846495,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields, Insomnia, and Levain before him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849123,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ross started it in his home kitchen\nwith no restaurant experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852626,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cookies were a side hustle,\nand the economics were friendly enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855587,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for him to piece together\nthe business as he went along."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944593,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Having been in the neighborhood\nfor so long,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946428,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cookie Good is a Santa Monica institution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949014,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While they offer delivery\nboth local and nationwide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951433,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through all the usual apps, shipping\nmakes up just 25% of revenue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955229,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A single cookie is $2.75\nand a dozen is $30."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017416,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ross enjoyed the highest profits\nwhen he baked out of his home from 2008"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020794,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 2010. Moving to a commercial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022963,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kitchen was the only way to keep up with demand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025173,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the rent cut into his margins. By 2014,\nthey had opened up in Santa Monica."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029595,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Revenue grew not just from the walk-in traffic, \nbut also from the businesses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033098,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the area who began ordering cookies\nfor clients, events, and employees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037227,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Store-level margins have persisted\nin the mid-teens year after year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040564,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is on par with Crumbl and Mrs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042566,
    "dDurationMs": 584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fields."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043150,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet Ross and Melanie have concerns\nthat business is going backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046528,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The entertainment industry\nnever fully recovered from the pandemic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049573,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the continuous layoffs\nhave pushed many away from the city."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052701,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The couple are now\nfocus on menu innovation with a new shelf-stable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055787,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gift-friendly product called\ncookie corn, where they make popcorn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059374,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "covered in caramel and roll it\nin their flavored cookie crumbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062711,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For Ross, seeing the success of Crumbl is tough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065088,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's hard for him not to think about\nwhat could have been and what almost was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285350,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other side of town are owners Ren"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287269,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Caroline of BakeSomeNoise who refuse to follow trends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290647,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in an era of crazy flavors, weekly\nrotations, and massive cookies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294442,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BakeSomeNoise only serves the classics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296653,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't have a physical shop\nand served their cookies warm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299364,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of an old-school Volkswagen bus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1301408,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "several nights a week on Sunset Boulevard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303785,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A single cookie is $4 and a dozen is $36."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357172,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like Ross, it was a crisis that triggered\ntheir leap into the cookie business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360967,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But unlike Cookie Good, who built\ntheir business through old-school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363845,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "word of mouth in the era before\nsocial media, Ren \u0026 Caroline built"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1367390,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BakeSomeNoise through new-school\ne-commerce,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369809,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pop culture, and virality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469409,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like with Cookie Good,\nthe business took a life of its own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472162,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the couple quickly outgrew their home\nkitchen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474372,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once again,\nthe economics were so favorable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1476666,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the couple could piece together\nat the business and recipe along the way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501775,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While virality and drops\nwere how they found their initial footing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504569,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ren and Caroline\nwere smart enough to adapt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506696,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to channel that lightning in a bottle\ninto a lasting business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1571219,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The typical playbook for cookie\nindependent is to scale with demand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574430,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You start with your home oven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1575807,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once you outgrow that, you rent\na commercial kitchen and then you save up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578810,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to open your own brick and mortar\nthat was like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651883,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of a generic food truck,\nthey opted for a custom 1972"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655261,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Volkswagen bus, which was cheaper\nthan the retail buildouts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1658056,
    "dDurationMs": 1459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they were getting quoted for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1659515,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Caroline and Ren are still figuring out\nhow to optimize the van,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1662518,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the most important thing for them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663978,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that everything is branded\nand remains on brand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666522,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet there's no such thing as originality\nin the cookie business,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1669442,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where everyone's come-up is near\nidentical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671819,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both Insomnia and Crumbl\nin their early days dabbled in food"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1674948,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trucks to get around the overhead\nof brick and mortar. In their first year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679118,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BakeSomeNoise grossed $240,000 a year as an online-only business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682997,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the virality faded after the pandemic,\nthey transitioned away from drops"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686709,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and towards catering and pop-ups\nto replace that online drop off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1689963,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sales have dipped in the past two years,\nbut with the van"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692382,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "finally online this year,\nthey're optimistic about the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695510,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By running lean,\nthey've kept operating margins at 35%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698638,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is comparable\nto Crumbl as a franchisor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701140,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what Cookie Good was making it home\nbefore they had to pay rent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1704227,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rent and Caroline have made more money\nselling cookies than they ever imagined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1707438,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the couple is adamant\nthat they'll only ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709440,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make the classics on their own terms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1743808,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cookies are easy to make, cheap to produce\nand simple to scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1746853,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But product alone\ndoes not make for a complete business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749605,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why there will never be\nany shortage of amateur"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751649,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bakers on Instagram\nselling cookies as a profit margins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1754610,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are really at their highest\nwhen it's made at home in small batches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758072,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not the ingredients or the labor, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1760074,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead the rent that kills margins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1762076,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The overhead of a brick and mortar,\nwhether it's one shop or ten shops, is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765413,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what creates problems for a business\nthat is fundamentally hindered"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1768374,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by small order sizes and low earnings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1770543,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why bootstrapped\nmom and pop cookie shops rarely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1773463,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if ever, scale beyond one store."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775506,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For better or worse,\nexpansion in this game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777925,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is only possible with outside investment,\nand profits at scale"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1781179,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can only be really\nachieved through franchising."
    } ]
  } ]
}
